## Interface: 16001, 120105
## Title: |cffC9A24ATwich|rUI Diagnostics
## Notes: Profiling and troubleshooting for TwichUI: record a capture, inspect it and copy a report. Loaded only when you open it (/tui perf); keep it turned on alongside TwichUI.
## Author: twichie
## Version: 1.0.0
## RequiredDeps: !!!TwichUI
## LoadOnDemand: 1
## SavedVariables: TwichUIDiagnosticsDB
## IconTexture: Interface\AddOns\!!!TwichUI\media\icon
## X-License: MIT (code); see !!!TwichUI\LICENSE
## Category: Interface Enhancements

# The namespace, preferences, clock, capability matrix and bounded containers (no frames)
Base.lua
# What TwichUI's R.Perf calls while a capture records (scopes, events, callbacks, counters)
Instrument.lua
Presets.lua
# What the operations are, and the gauges read from TwichUI's modules' own snapshots
Gauges.lua
# The frame sampler and interval readings (one frame, scripted only while recording)
Collect.lua
Session.lua
Findings.lua
Compare.lua
Json.lua
Export.lua
# The workspace: charts, then the window (last: it tells TwichUI the addon is ready)
Charts.lua
Window.lua
